{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>From where have you come, and where are you going?</b> That is to say: look and see from what place you have departed — you were in a holy place, in the home of the righteous — and now you are journeying outside the land to an impure place and to wicked people." "<b>I am fleeing.</b> I am not going to a destination known to me; rather, I set out in order to flee."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:30:17.887203146Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}